libsmfc — a simple Standard MIDI File writer by loveemu.

Vendored into caesar from loveemu's "loveemu-lab" repository (the sseq2mid
converter), which distributes it under the MIT License reproduced below.
caesar's copies of libsmfc.c, libsmfc.h, libsmfcx.c, and libsmfcx.h are
identical to that upstream source.

Upstream: https://github.com/loveemu/loveemu-lab (nds/sseq2mid/src)

The MIT License is compatible with caesar's GPL-3.0 license; this notice is
retained to satisfy the MIT requirement that the copyright and permission
notice accompany all copies.

